ely connect with the opponent\'s range.\n\nReason: Since the opponent checked the flop and has shown no aggression, checking allows you to see the River card for free. There is no value in betting as a bluff because the board hits many hands the opponent might hold, and you have zero equity if called. Preserving chips is the best strategy here given your lead in the overall match.\n\nAnswer: 0'}
