e blinds.\n\nReason: You have trips (three 10s) with a strong kicker. The opponent has shown no aggression. Betting now would likely cause them to fold, winning only a small pot. Checking disguises your hand strength and gives the opponent a chance to improve or bluff on the river, potentially increasing the pot size.\n\nAnswer: 0'}
